---
import { APPLY_FORM_URL } from "../consts";
---

<section id="top" class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- 背景の淡いグラデ -->
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10">
    <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-[-10%] h-[420px] w-[820px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-brand/10 blur-3xl"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 pt-16 pb-10 text-center md:pt-24">
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-brand/20 bg-brand/5 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-brand">
      <span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand"></span>
      モニター店舗募集中 ｜ 招待制のB2Bサービス
    </span>
    <h1 class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-3xl text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.18] tracking-tight md:text-6xl">
      <span class="inline-block">かざすだけで、</span>
      <span class="inline-block"><span class="text-brand">買取価格</span>がわかる。</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl px-1 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 md:text-lg" style="text-wrap: balance;">
      <span class="inline-block">商品を撮るだけで、<span class="whitespace-nowrap">中古相場</span>・<span class="whitespace-nowrap">推奨買取価格</span>・<span class="whitespace-nowrap">想定粗利</span>をその場で算出。</span>
      <span class="inline-block"><span class="whitespace-nowrap">楽天／Yahoo!</span>の実勢価格、査定履歴、<span class="whitespace-nowrap">古物台帳CSV</span>まで。</span>
      <span class="inline-block">いま<strong class="text-slate-800 whitespace-nowrap">100件まで無料</strong>の<span class="whitespace-nowrap">モニターを募集</span>しています。</span>
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
      <a href={APPLY_FORM_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="rounded-xl bg-brand px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm transition-colors hover:bg-brand-600">
        無料モニターに応募
      </a>
      <a href="#how" class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:bg-slate-50">
        使い方を見る
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-slate-400">リユース・買取店向け／査定100件まで無料・審査のうえご案内します</p>
  </div>

  <!-- 縦動画（スマホ）向けプロダクトデモ -->
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 pb-20">
    <div class="phone-frame floaty mx-auto" data-reveal>
      <!-- ノッチ風バー -->
      <div class="phone-notch"></div>
      <video
        class="h-full w-full object-cover"
        autoplay
        muted
        loop
        playsinline
        poster="/media/demo-poster.svg"
      >
        <source src="/media/demo.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
      </video>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-10 text-center text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400">
      リユース／買取／リサイクル店の査定業務に
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
